OL,3,ASearch for survivors of Nepal-Tibet
OL,4,Aflood enters fourth day with almost
OL,5,A2,000 still missing
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 1,924 people are missing in
OL,8,FNepal, the country's disaster relief
OL,9,Fagency says
OL,11,FAmong them are at least 517 foreign
OL,12,Fnationals - but the situation is
OL,13,Ffast-moving and different authorities
OL,14,Fhave produced different figures
OL,16,FThe death toll in Nepal has risen to
OL,17,F579, the disaster relief agency says,
OL,18,Fand at least seven people have died in
OL,19,FTibet, with 554 missing
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
